cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Scout Smarter: Learning Where to Measure in Onion Fields with a farm-ng Amiga"
abstract: >-
  Simulation-based reinforcement learning for adaptive robotic crop scouting. A farm-ng Amiga
  robot scouts Vidalia onion fields (plant height with an Intel RealSense D455, NDVI with a red +
  NIR camera) under a fixed sampling protocol; a policy trained by simulation-based policy
  iteration with common random numbers decides how many plants to measure in each 10-ft block,
  trading map accuracy against robot time, on real drone-mapped (DJI Mavic 3M) onion fields.
authors:
